    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal-raising games are in a &quot;peaceful&quot; state. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking at the animal, &quot;It's cute&quot;, &quot;This is how I decorate it&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It showed a positive response </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But we changed the format. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a way to show the reality that it's hard to raise a turtle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think it's easy to raise a turtle? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think I'll answer &quot;no&quot; to that answer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you play this game, you'll change your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/d599ba78939d5250792094fc214d87d0.avif?t=1754387963\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the owner of a turtle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I think it's an easy animal to raise </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??? : Don't you just need to change the water? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??? : Don't you just have to feed hard and give love? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I think all of these answers are about the perspective of thinking in the game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll re-create it from a new perspective and let players </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is made to be easy to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's awkwardly a game of raising neglect + clicher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes care of the turtle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money over time together </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I bought a variety of items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decorate the turtle's fish tank beautifully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This small fish tank</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/53752ef47b5b62e5818e284aa579abcf.avif?t=1754387963\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's changed like this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/b0eb5db69b5f209025beec585a2eeff0.avif?t=1754387963\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bigger fish tank is also waiting for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to give valuable food to the turtle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wide variety of food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/b7cde52803d0b5d6928fec0a273ec0c7.avif?t=1754387963\" width=189 height=351 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides that, I'm going to give a variety of food to &quot;turtles&quot; as a &quot;dream&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollution can also control hunger stress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???: Do users just watch the turtle's growth process? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, it's not a realistic process of turtle growth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollution levels must be managed in real time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just have to &quot;left click of mouse&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/f809b406f3eeac05c89b2f23c5b4d34b.avif?t=1754387963\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollution I clicked hard </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unclicked Contamination </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/dec82205bd18ea042c6c5262aa5d8570.avif?t=1754387963\" width=182 height=267 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??? : Then is it over if I manage it while using the click shop? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, there are &quot;variables&quot; in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased stress in turtles due to the appearance of cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??? : How do turtles and cats live together? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team planner is really doing it... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a break that shows the limitations of consumables </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please save the turtle by repurchasing it </p>",
