9040/extras/f809b406f3eeac05c89b2f23c5b4d34b.avif?t=1754387963\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pollution I clicked hard </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unclicked Contamination </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829040/extras/dec82205bd18ea042c6c5262aa5d8570.avif?t=1754387963\" width=182 height=267 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??? : Then is it over if I manage it while using the click shop? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, there are &quot;variables&quot; in the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased stress in turtles due to the appearance of cats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >??? : How do turtles and cats live together? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our team planner is really doing it... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a break that shows the limitations of consumables </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please save the turtle by repurchasing it </p>",
